          "heading": "France winger Mickael Guillard calls Jiuta Wainiqolo 'a phenomenon' before Lyon",
          "body": "France winger Mickael Guillard says France's focus is on the Flying Fijians in Lyon, not on world champions South Africa. Guillard spoke of Jiuta Wainiqolo, his club team-mate, as \"a phenomenon\" but said France know they cannot give him too much ball or space. Bayonne have also confirmed the release of tighthead prop Luke Tagi to join the Flying Fijians for the Nations Championship."
