          "kicker": "Contract news",
          "heading": "Seb Atkinson commits to Gloucester until 2029, turning down options to leave",
          "body": "England centre Seb Atkinson has signed a new contract to stay at Gloucester until at least 2029, passing up options to leave the club, head coach George Skivington said. The 24-year-old has played seven times for England since his first cap in July 2025, and has started 79 of the 84 games he has played for Gloucester, who are currently top of the Premiership. Skivington said: \"This is a really significant re-signing for us.\""
