      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Fiji focus",
          "heading": "Mickael Guillard says France have not discussed South Africa, focused on Fiji",
          "body": "France winger Mickael Guillard says the squad has not discussed their clash with world champions South Africa, and that the focus is on the Nations Championship opener against Fiji in Lyon. “We’re focused on Fiji,” he told RugbyRama. He described the Flying Fijians as instinctive and very strong in open play, and said France must get back into position quickly whenever they lose possession. Guillard also said he is looking forward to facing his club team-mate Jiuta Wainiqolo."
        },
