          "heading": "Quesada expects Tommaso Allan at significant part of Friday training",
          "body": "Tommaso Allan is building back from injury, and Gonzalo Quesada says he should take part in a significant part of Friday's training session, with a return to full work targeted for the following week. Allan is among the players being considered for the matchday squad, but Quesada says that decision depends on his condition. For Italy, his progress matters as the Azzurri open a run of four consecutive Tests against top-ten opposition, starting with South Africa."
