          "kicker": "Coaching belief",
          "heading": "Townsend says Scotland now believe they can beat All Blacks",
          "body": "Scotland have never beaten New Zealand, and Gregor Townsend says that is no longer a mindset his squad carries. Speaking on the BBC Scotland Rugby Podcast, the coach contrasted his playing days, when he felt the Scots could never win, with his time in charge: 'I've not felt that as a coach.' Scotland face the All Blacks at Murrayfield in the Nations Championship, having lost all three of Townsend's previous meetings with them, the last 25-17 in 2025."
