          "kicker": "Selection fallout",
          "heading": "Freddie Thomas says Wales omission gives him extra energy at Gloucester",
          "body": "Gloucester lock Freddie Thomas has turned his omission from Steve Tandy's Wales squad into motivation. Thomas, who scored a try in Gloucester's win over Bath, said the call-up news was \"really disappointing\" but that it has given him \"extra energy\". He told BBC Radio Gloucestershire that Tandy was clear about the areas he must improve, and he believes his versatility, playing both second row and back row, may have counted against him as a question mark with Welsh coaches. Gloucester next face champions Northampton on Saturday."
        },
