          "heading": "Contepomi's Pumas face Ireland, Italy and France in three November tests",
          "body": "Felipe Contepomi's side opens its three-match European tour against Ireland in Dublin, then faces Italy in Genoa and France in Saint-Denis before the finals weekend in London. Argentina enter November fourth in the Southern Hemisphere standings with seven championship points, one behind third-placed Australia, and the coverage frames the tour as a chance to close that gap. Their July results were a win over Wales and defeats to Scotland and England."
        },
