          "body": "Kurtley Beale answered Les Kiss's SOS call to join the Wallabies' spring tour of the UK, replacing midfielder Hunter Paisami, who is unavailable for personal reasons. The 37-year-old has 95 Test caps and last played for Australia against Wales in Cardiff in 2021. The Guardian reports Kiss is seemingly considering backing a proven No 10 to end the revolving door at five-eighth, with James Ramm and Kalani Thomas also added to the touring group."
